cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "DLC Labeler"
abstract: >
  A web app for DeepLabCut keypoint labeling on stereo video: manual
  frame labeling, MediaPipe-assisted framing, model predictions in 2D and
  3D, correction and refinement rounds, and local job management. A
  stripped-down fork of Movement Tracker focused on field-standard
  DeepLabCut analysis.
authors:
  - family-names: Newbold
    given-names: Dillan
repository-code: https://github.com/newboldd/movement-tracker
license: BUSL-1.1
type: software
